  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Community Schools: Promoting Active Learning</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We will set up 5 community schools for 500 children in the most marginalized districts of Balochistan &amp; Sindh where there are no primary schools for girls and have the lowest literacy rates worldwide.  These will be cost effective models working on the latest educational techniques incorporating e-lessons on Single National Curriculum to be at par with the rest of the country.   ALBBS aims to empower these children through literacy &amp; essential lifelong learning skills for a brighter future.</narrative>
  </description>
